111	<div class="page">
112	<header class="masthead">
113	<p class="eyebrow">Fortress revival &middot; coordinator skill &middot; skill drafts &middot; version 4 &middot; 5 November 2026</p>
114	<h1>Your held rules, version 4</h1>
115	<p class="standfirst">Version 4: what landed in the coordinator skill since your approvals of drafts 12 and 13, fourteen changes, each as a diff with its reason. No change waits for your yes.</p>
116	</header>
117	
118	<nav class="parts" aria-label="Sections">
119	<h2>Sections</h2>
120	<ul>
121	<li><a href="#landed">What landed before</a></li>
122	<li><a href="#s1">Landed since your last approval</a></li>
123	<li><a href="#s2">Proposed changes</a></li>
124	<li><a href="#words">Words used on this page</a></li>
125	</ul>
126	</nav>
